This product fetches data at run time from services it does not
include or redistribute:

  - Space weather indices from the NOAA Space Weather Prediction
    Center (services.swpc.noaa.gov).
  - Place name search from Open-Meteo (open-meteo.com), whose
    geocoding data comes from OpenStreetMap contributors.

Forecasts are climatology with a probability attached. They are not a
guarantee that any path will be workable at any time.
